.TH CAT "1" "April 2026" "PiggyOS" "User Commands"

.SH NAME
cat \- concatenate files and print to the standard output

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cat
[\fI\,FILE\/\fR]...

.SH DESCRIPTION

.PP
Concatenate FILE(s) to standard output.

.PP
With no FILE, or when FILE is \-, read standard input.

.SH OPTIONS
None.

